# Prototype Template Rules

## Goal

Ship prototypes fast without creating unmaintainable code. Every feature should be easy to extend or delete.

## File size

- **Never** create 400+ line files with multiple responsibilities
- One exported function/component per file when practical
- Compose in `index.ts` / `index.tsx` in the same subdirectory

## Layering

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Routes | `app/` | Page composition, minimal logic |
| API | `app/api/` | HTTP handlers, validation, call libs/db |
| UI (lander) | `components/lander/` | Marketing UI, hardcoded data |
| UI (app) | `components/app/` | Product UI |
| UI primitives | `components/ui/` | shadcn only |
| CRUD | `db/<domain>/index.ts` | Supabase reads/writes |
| Logic | `libs/<domain>/` | Pure business functions |
| Schemas | `utils/schema/` | Zod schemas + inferred types |
| Tests | `tests/` | Mirror source tree |

## Data

- **Landers**: hardcoded const data in component subdirs — no DB calls
- **App**: fetch via server components, server actions, or API routes
- **Never** put CRUD in React components

## Types

- Segment interfaces by domain in `lib/types/<domain>.ts` or colocate with schemas
- Prefer `interface` over `type` for object shapes
- No enums — use `as const` maps

## Design system

- Base theme: shadcn neutral black/white (light + `.dark`)
- **Accent**: `--brand-accent` in `globals.css` — subagent must ask user and set
- Accent drives: primary buttons, tabs, toggle groups, compact controls
- Fonts: `.font-primary` (body/UI), `.font-secondary` (headlines/display) — two fonts only
- **Styling**: read `styling.mdc` — props over `className`, global UI changes in `components/ui/`

## Testing

- Add tests when implementing a feature
- Mirror path: `libs/auth/foo.ts` → `tests/libs/auth/foo.test.ts`

## Dynamic design

- Build reusable layout primitives before page-specific UI
- Prefer composition over one-off styles
- Use Framer Motion for meaningful transitions, not decoration everywhere
